<title>FRANCE: TABLE-French consumer prices unchanged in June.</title>
<headline>TABLE-French consumer prices unchanged in June.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics institute INSEE gave the following provisional data:</p>
<p>				    Jun	  May     June 1996</p>
<p> Month-on-month inflation   0.0	  0.2	 -0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year inflation     1.0	  0.9	  2.3</p>
<p> CPI Index (base 1990)    115.2	115.2	114.1</p>
<p>INSEE gave the following breakdown of the consumer price index for all households in mainland France, base 1990.</p>
<p>     Category		 Weight(pct) index  1-mo   3-mo  yr/yr</p>
<p> Food excluding tobacco	 2020    108.9   0.0    1.0    1.2</p>
<p> Private-sector manufactures  3277    108.6  -0.2   -0.4   -0.3</p>
<p> Private-sector services	1964    126.9   0.2    0.7    1.8</p>
<p> Energy				866    113.1  -0.3   -1.6    1.9</p>
<p> Public services ex energy     646    131.0   0.0    0.3    2.8</p>
<p> Rent, water			 668    130.6   0.1    0.2    1.5</p>
<p> Health spending		   559    110.7   0.4    0.6    0.7</p>
<p> Total excluding tobacco	9802    114.1   0.0    0.2    0.9</p>
<p>Cumulative inflation in the first six months of 1997 was 0.7 pct, INSEE said. -- Paris Newsroom 33(1) 4221 5452</p>
</text>
